    "sections": {
        "description": "The Pastry Shop Theme is a charming, feature-rich website template designed specifically for pastry shops, bakeries, and dessert cafés. Ideal for showcasing artisanal pastries, gourmet creations, and a diverse pastry menu, this theme provides bakery owners with a professional online presence that captures the essence of a local pastry shop. Built to highlight both sweet and savoury offerings, it’s perfect for cafes specialising in chocolate pastries, French pastries, or custom treats. Developed using Elementor for easy drag-and-drop editing, it allows full customization without any coding skills. Its clean, visually appealing design emphasises high-quality pastry images, with sections dedicated to displaying collections ranging from flaky croissants to mini pastries for party platters. The theme includes flexible layouts to highlight pastry specialties, wedding pastries, seasonal treats, and signature dessert boxes. Designed to support a seamless shopping experience, it’s perfect for shops offering online pastry orders, delivery, or pastry box subscriptions. Featuring interactive menus and sections for holiday specials, luxury pastries, and gluten-free or vegan options, it also offers elegant display areas for showcasing dessert counters and featured items. Optimized for mobile viewing, bakery SEO, and dessert eCommerce, this theme is ideal for growing a modern, deliciously engaging online pastry brand."
    },
